        "TileImage": "$($repository 3880a7bb-7b59-4a0c-87f2-590e87ccb1ce).Image",
        "Description": "We have a very interesting client today, 47.\rThe Vermont state government has hired us to covertly eliminate Helen West and all of her employees.\rThey have suspected her of being a serial poisoner for a while now, but they never had enough evidence to get a warrant. \r\rThat is where you come in, 47.\rYour objective is to eliminate Helen West and all of her employees in Whittleton Creek. You must minimize Non-Target deaths, and avoid being recorded. \r\rThis is a very powerful client 47.",
